#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Ejercicio"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Ver también"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr "<a cbot>Programación</a>, <a cbot|type>tipos</a> y <a cbot|category>categorías</a>."

#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote control #1"
msgstr "Control remoto #1"

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "remote"
msgstr "remoto"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "A <a object|botsr>sniffer</a> (can't carry anything)."
msgstr "Un <a object|botsr>olfateador</a> (no puede cargar nada)."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "An <a object|exchange>information exchange post</a> that receives information from a sender and then transmits it to a receiver."
msgstr "Un <a object|exchange>puesto de intercambio de información</a> que recibe información de un transmisor y luego la transmite a un receptor."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "tremot1a"
msgstr "tremot1a"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "    name=\"order\", valuer=order number"
msgstr "    name=\"order\", valuer=número de orden"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    1 -> grab();     // take an object\n"
"    2 -> drop();     // drop an object\n"
"    3 -> move(10);   // move 10 meters forward\n"
"    4 -> move(-10);  // move 10 meters backwards"
msgstr ""
"    1 -> grab();     // tomar un objeto\n"
"    2 -> drop();     // soltar un objeto\n"
"    3 -> move(10);   // avanzar 10 metros\n"
"    4 -> move(-10);  // retroceder 10 metros"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To instruct the slave to move forward 10 meters all you have to do is:\n"
"<c/><s/>\t<a cbot|send>send</a>(\"order\", 3, 100);  // order 3 -> \"move(10)\""
msgstr ""
"Para indicar al esclavo que avance 10 metros todo lo que tienes que hacer es:\n"
"<c/><s/>\t<a cbot|send>send</a>(\"order\", 3, 100);  // orden 3 -> \"move(10)\""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the send instruction we wait for 5 seconds to be sure the move is done.\n"
"<c/><s/>\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);"
msgstr ""
"Después de la instrucción send esperamos 5 segundos para asegurarnos de que el movimiento se ha realizado.\n"
"<c/><s/>\t<a cbot|wait>wait</a>(5);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remark: There is a better way for waiting the order has been executed, but we'll see this later in exercise \"Remote Control #2\"."
msgstr "Observación: Hay una mejor forma de esperar a que se ejecute la orden, pero lo veremos más adelante en el ejercicio \"Control Remoto #2\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "To finish the exercise you must:"
msgstr "Para terminar el ejercicio debes:"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take the uranium ore"
msgstr "Tomar el mineral de uranio"

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move forward by 10 meters"
msgstr "Avanzar 10 metros"

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the uranium ore"
msgstr "Soltar el mineral de uranio"

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move backwards by 10 meters"
msgstr "Retroceder 10 metros"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "It's up to you to write the program."
msgstr "Te toca a ti escribir el programa."

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote control a robot using an information exchange post, so it will transport uranium ore."
msgstr "Controla remotamente un robot usando un puesto de intercambio de información, para que transporte mineral de uranio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Remote control a robot using an <a object|exchange>information exchange post</a>, so it will transport <a object|uranore>uranium ore</a>.\n"
"The main actors of this exercise are:"
msgstr ""
"Controla remotamente un robot usando un <a object|exchange>puesto de intercambio de información</a>, para que transporte <a object|uranore>mineral de uranio</a>.\n"
"Los actores principales de este ejercicio son:"

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "A <a object|botgr>grabber</a> which waits for orders from the exchange post. You have no way control this robot directly."
msgstr "Un <a object|botgr>recolector</a> que espera órdenes del puesto de intercambio. No tienes forma de controlar este robot directamente."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "An information exchange post stores \"name/value\" couples. To control the \"slave\" robot we use just one couple:"
msgstr "Un puesto de intercambio de información almacena parejas \"nombre/valor\". Para controlar el robot \"esclavo\" usamos solo una pareja:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "The slave robot understands following orders:"
msgstr "El robot esclavo entiende las siguientes órdenes:"
